"return of ``set_hmirror()`` / ``set_vflip()`` (:ref:`the mirror/flip change "
"<v2_7_0_mirror>`)."
msgstr ""
"Przeniesienie ``set_auto_whitebal()`` na ``rgb_gain_db=`` + "
